Ultimate “Ship It” Checklist
(Use this as a master Kanban. Every line = a PR / commit. Tick-off left→right; nothing should be merged half-done.)

0 Meta
Create milestone v1.0.0 on GitHub; add the checklist as issues → project board.
Enable branch protection: lint + type-check + test + build must pass.
1 Code Quality & Types
1.1 Monorepo hygiene
pnpm-lock: run pnpm install --frozen-lockfile → commit any lock drift.
Turbo cache: prune .turbo/daemon/_ logs from repo (.gitignore).
1.2 ESLint / TypeScript
UI package: 0 errors / 0 warnings
Refactor src/animations/premium-motion.ts into valid Variants.
Cast or label-string whileHover, whileTap.
Fix HTMLInputElement | null return in useImperativeHandle.
Mobile package:
Rename
jest.setup.ts
→ jest.setup.tsx, add import React.
Remove duplicate keys (InCallManager mock).
Replace all <> fragments with children as React.ReactElement | null or keep JSX since file is now
.tsx
.
Add missing imports (Dimensions, Platform, etc.).
Web package:
jest.config.(js|ts) → testPathIgnorePatterns for Playwright specs.
Strict-boolean-expression fixes in hooks.
Run:
pnpm lint --fix # all packages
pnpm turbo run type-check
2 Tests
2.1 Unit
ENSURE 80 % coverage in each workspace (coverageThreshold in Jest).
Fix failing suites in apps/mobile/src/screens/calling/**tests**. Root cause:
IncomingCallScreen
import path and host-component detection.
2.2 Integration
Server pact + supertest at tests/contracts/_ must be green.
Core stores: add tests for useWeatherStore, useSwipeLogic.
2.3 E2E
Web: Playwright tests/playwright/_ happy path - login→match→chat.
Mobile: Detox “swipe / like / message” script. Run on CI’s Android emulator.
3 Builds
Web (Next 15): apps/web – pnpm build passes, no hydration warnings.
Mobile (Expo 50 SDK): expo prebuild clean → eas build --profile production.
Server (Node 18): pnpm build && node dist/server.js --dry-run binds port 5001.
4 Performance & UX
Lighthouse budgets ≥ 90 (perf, PWA, a11y, SEO) – script in tests/performance/.
Mobile bundle ≤ 8 MB; enable Hermes & Proguard.
Add React-Native Skia placeholder images for initial load.
Implement skeleton loaders for Map & Swipe screens.
5 Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)
✅ Color contrast check via axe (web) & RTL a11y (mobile).
All buttons/inputs have accessibilityLabel/aria-label.
Keyboard nav: focus rings on web components.
Motion safe / reduced-motion media queries.
6 Security
pnpm audit --prod → 0 high/critical.
Rate-limit /auth/_ endpoints (express-rate-limit).
Helmet & CORS configured on server.
Secrets via .env + GitHub Secrets; no keys in repo.
7 Observability
Sentry DSN loaded from env in mobile, web, server.
Winston + morgan logs -> server/logs/\*.log, daily rotation.
Health endpoint: GET /healthz returns { status:"ok", uptime }.
8 DevOps
Docker:
docker compose -f deploy/docker-compose.prod.yml build
docker compose up -d
Verify web :3000, api :5001, mongo :27017.
Netlify (web): netlify.toml build & env.
EAS submit (mobile): Android AAB & iOS.
GitHub Actions workflow:
Install pnpm
turbo run lint type-check test build
Upload artefacts
Deploy on tag.
9 Documentation
Update README.md quick-start, tech stack, scripts.
DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md – one-command Docker + EAS guide.
CHANGELOG.md – semantic-version history.
Storybook (ui) – run pnpm storybook and add to docs.
10 Product QA
Smoke: Create user → add pet → swipe → match → chat → place call.
Regression sheet (Google Sheets) – mark pass/fail.
Beta testers via Expo TestFlight & Play Store Internal.
Completion criteria = All check-boxes ticked, CI green, release tag v1.0.0.
